  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7ec669a3e0a2d69",
      "translationZh": "Nvidia GTX-1080Ti 有 11GB 显存，能够运行 8B 到 14B 的本地模型。我加装了一块配备 16GB 显存的 AMD Radeon MI50。现在有了 27GB 显存，我能够将大多数 30B 到 35B 的本地模型放在显存中运行。我花了不到 140 买到这块 MI50 GPU，并将其固件刷成了 Radeon VII，这样 mini Display 接口就能用了，但功率水平也降低了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d742088205eb567",
      "translationZh": "基准测试使用的是 Llama.cpp Ubuntu Vulkan 预编译二进制版本：851cb34f2 (11055)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28e701a4749b8e5e",
      "translationZh": "得益于 Kubuntu 和 Vulkan，没有驱动方面的麻烦或冲突。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd9ce3530d587813",
      "translationZh": "我先单独使用 GTX-1080Ti 运行，这会导致 CPU/GPU 卸载（GGML_VK_VISIBLE_DEVICES=1）。然后用双 GPU 配置运行相同的 LLM 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30ffdc030c8be5bb",
      "translationZh": "我添加了 sleep 10 命令，让系统有时间为下一次运行做好准备。以下是我使用的命令：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b3b6404ce64856da",
      "translationZh": "单 GPU 结果（可见设备 = 1 GTX-1080Ti）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1714a37555d7383b",
      "translationZh": "模型 大小 参数 pp512 tg128",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22f12fb4c59812b1",
      "translationZh": "qwen35moe 35B.A3B MXFP4 混合专家（MoE）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "272c1077ad5f1049",
      "translationZh": "nemotron_h_moe 31B.A3.5B Q5_K - 中等",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b015d052c3dead2f",
      "translationZh": "双 GPU 结果（速度更快的 GTX-1080Ti 和 Radeon MI50）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0313421391453d4",
      "translationZh": "稠密模型受益最多：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f31a237dae06a709",
      "translationZh": "Gemma3 27B 的生成速度提升了惊人的 ~896%（从 1.5 t/s 提高到 14.96 t/s）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a72856cc30102bb5",
      "translationZh": "Qwen35 27B 提升了 ~642%（从 2.1 t/s 提高到 15.6 t/s）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af9919f654cb12d6",
      "translationZh": "Nemotron 31B 提升了 ~504%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8011834b138deb03",
      "translationZh": "考虑到添加一块 16GB 显存的 GPU 成本不到 140，这样的结果非常出色。现在，运行 30B 规模的稠密模型确实成了一个可行的选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26c21ca02cee1e5d",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/tabletuser_blogspot 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "VRAM",
